WEBVTT

intro
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
DUMB brings your media tools into one dashboard.
Choose the applications and workflow you need.

workflow
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Start with one workflow and one media server.
DUMB manages the apps; you choose how your library works.

install
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Use the deployment guide for your platform.
Keep configuration and application data in persistent storage.

dashboard
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:39.000
The dashboard shows the services in your DUMB installation.
Open a service to review its status and controls.

service
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:49.000
A service page brings its controls, settings and logs together.
Use the embedded application to finish its own setup.

logs
00:00:49.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Logs show what the selected service is doing.
Filter messages by name or level to focus on the problem.

updates
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Open Tools → Updates and check for an available version.
Review the result before choosing to install; this example only checks.

appearance
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Use appearance settings to choose a comfortable dashboard view.
These preferences change how the frontend is displayed.

metrics
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Metrics help you review resource use and spot pressure.
Use the charts alongside the affected service's logs.

closing
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Follow the deployment guide, then complete first-run setup.
Test one import and playback before expanding your stack.
